  <name>Camera Core</name>
  <description>Core components for the Jetpack Camera Library, a library providing a consistent and reliable camera foundation that enables great camera driven experiences across all of Android. This library includes code from libyuv, which is licensed under the BSD-3-Clause license.</description>
  <url>https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/camera#1.6.0</url>
  <inceptionYear>2019</inceptionYear>
